        "quote": "(a) Each person vested under the Kansas Public Employees Retirement System, including KP&F, who is employed by the City and who retires or retired from active employment after December 31, 1988, shall be eligible to receive health care benefits coverage under the plan upon written application filed with the Director of Human Resources within 30 days following retirement of the employee. Retirees and their dependent family members who have coverage under the City’s group health insurance plan immediately prior to the effective date of the ordinance codified in this article shall remain covered and eligible to continue such coverage under the plan without filing a written application under this section as a condition of retaining or continuing such coverage.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.125.330:block:0#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
